llzuk4k", "value": "<p>Mais frescura, mais sabor.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "163cbaf178597eb39d79409d80789887bd95396645caec4477059689793e41fc"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.index.json.section_Rassurance.row__r2__t.text:5yzeymxbq29v", "value": "<h3>Enviado desde París</h3>", "translatableContentDigest": "33d3e1cda303041b3ab399f676e8d65ed63c94b59ee91af38b5dcd81a22f3e86"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.section_Rassurance.row__r2__t.text:5yzeymxbq29v", "value": "<h3>Enviado de Paris</h3>", "translatableContentDigest": "33d3e1cda303041b3ab399f676e8d65ed63c94b59ee91af38b5dcd81a22f3e86"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.index.json.section_Rassurance.row__r2__p.text:1hh4hictloykn", "value": "<p>Chronopost, en 2 a 3 días laborables.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "14ea43b69b9fe5b1e619fcf0c2c73693ab4adddbb8d2b68493f8346c668785d0"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.section_Rassurance.row__r2__p.text:1hh4hictloykn", "value": "<p>Chronopost, em 2 a 3 dias úteis.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "14ea43b69b9fe5b1e619fcf0c2c73693ab4adddbb8d2b68493f8346c668785d0"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.index.json.section_Intro.t2.text:2jayw8r20gko", "value": "<h2>Pocos aceites, todos probados.</h2>", "translatableContentDigest": "04e147c18ae4d33e9486511052f6d166866a9c01cf1ce817e38387f62f414f53"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.section_Intro.t2.text:2jayw8r20gko", "value": "<h2>Poucos azeites, todos provados.</h2>", "translatableContentDigest": "04e147c18ae4d33e9486511052f6d166866a9c01cf1ce817e38387f62f414f53"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.index.json.section_Intro.t3.text:3sade15ryut61", "value": "<p>Trabajamos directamente con productores andaluces. De sus aceites, solo nos quedamos con los que servimos en nuestra propia mesa.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "8706e8ff785a10d293326fda8af15b5c136a1d9c38fcdbb8d45477968a9dd7eb"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.section_Intro.t3.text:3sade15ryut61", "value": "<p>Trabalhamos diretamente com produtores andaluzes. Dos seus azeites, ficamos apenas com os que servimos à nossa própria mesa.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "8706e8ff785a10d293326fda8af15b5c136a1d9c38fcdbb8d45477968a9dd7eb"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.index.json.product_list_Huiles.static-header__title.text:2yg3ojsbq8g8r", "value": "<h3>Nuestros aceites</h3>", "translatableContentDigest": "e3015ee0d75e03c728c273fffe6aede0efb815c0c4bdd2d0677f3c64cf5fd326"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.product_list_Huiles.static-header__title.text:2yg3ojsbq8g8r", "value": "<h3>Os nossos azeites</h3>", "translatableContentDigest": "e3015ee0d75e03c728c273fffe6aede0efb815c0c4bdd2d0677f3c64cf5fd326"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.index.json.product_list_Huiles.static-header__view_all.label:2qyvf0001kbbn", "value": "Ver todo", "translatableContentDigest": "ecca5f45eb3b1f16f113aeb37791da190f3d232ba3809f13f27f158fd36022d3"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.product_list_Huiles.static-header__view_all.label:2qyvf0001kbbn", "value": "Ver tudo", "translatableContentDigest": "ecca5f45eb3b1f16f113aeb37791da190f3d232ba3809f13f27f158fd36022d3"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.index.json.section_Guide.h.text:jddln534g59u", "value": "<h2>¿Qué aceite es para ti?</h2>", "translatableContentDigest": "8177c0f999fd4a5bab23ff03179bca4e5c9e5732ed3273019ad614add8a47d36"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.section_Guide.h.text:jddln534g59u", "value": "<h2>Que azeite é para si?</h2>", "translatableContentDigest": "8177c0f999fd4a5bab23ff03179bca4e5c9e5732ed3273019ad614add8a47d36"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.index.json.section_Guide.row__c0__l.text:vrjy4tuvaapb", "value": "<p>01 · Para el día a día</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "8fc116fcdabeb7a4f7867d25342c7686c0a80ef53d1bd5e70aeeb2cc472da1f7"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.section_Guide.row__c0__l.text:vrjy4tuvaapb", "value": "<p>01 · No dia a dia</p>", "trans