xt:168jbjxn5oqvo", "value": "<h3>Para oferecer</h3>", "translatableContentDigest": "f9377e02a5a99aa84c45c0b247a12d25725e26130400b9e6a082cfcc862111fd"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.index.json.section_Guide.row__c3__p.text:3qvsa19x0ibdc", "value": "<p>Tres variedades para probar una al lado de la otra.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "e43d613b0c4615516badff2fe23416a5603dd2b550f715af7ed7276370fe9a0e"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.section_Guide.row__c3__p.text:3qvsa19x0ibdc", "value": "<p>Três variedades para provar lado a lado.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "e43d613b0c4615516badff2fe23416a5603dd2b550f715af7ed7276370fe9a0e"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.index.json.section_Guide.row__c3__b.label:3m8u22lcrisxl", "value": "El estuche", "translatableContentDigest": "974d16fd6e369ee288270e963a13a58ceee87d3bde8868feedfac2bf2ef32bc3"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.section_Guide.row__c3__b.label:3m8u22lcrisxl", "value": "A caixa", "translatableContentDigest": "974d16fd6e369ee288270e963a13a58ceee87d3bde8868feedfac2bf2ef32bc3"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.index.json.media_with_content_CwFqjm.content__g1__h.text:zw0g8w7mxkl1", "value": "<h2>Cosecha temprana, prensado en frío</h2>", "translatableContentDigest": "9b107c25f8c601860d50cf36c31bc321ecaa5ccbaaa0e358bfb4cbe5715bf118"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.media_with_content_CwFqjm.content__g1__h.text:zw0g8w7mxkl1", "value": "<h2>Colheita precoce, prensado a frio</h2>", "translatableContentDigest": "9b107c25f8c601860d50cf36c31bc321ecaa5ccbaaa0e358bfb4cbe5715bf118"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.index.json.media_with_content_CwFqjm.content__g1__p.text:29zqd28hu5egd", "value": "<p>Las aceitunas se recogen al inicio de la temporada. El aceite conserva más frescura, notas de hierba y un ligero amargor al final.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "fa10063f61ffd8c04fec5e6166a74a1d98027409c10335a4af7321b5aef735fa"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.media_with_content_CwFqjm.content__g1__p.text:29zqd28hu5egd", "value": "<p>As azeitonas são colhidas no início da época. O azeite guarda mais frescura, notas de erva e um ligeiro amargo no final.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "fa10063f61ffd8c04fec5e6166a74a1d98027409c10335a4af7321b5aef735fa"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.index.json.media_with_content_CwFqjm.content__g2__b.label:36ozn2e3rcacn", "value": "Probar la primera cosecha", "translatableContentDigest": "d5462dbc8f4715c7404f9a1fb88cd3984c4352756da7ac09747d848f6a349438"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.media_with_content_CwFqjm.content__g2__b.label:36ozn2e3rcacn", "value": "Provar a primeira colheita", "translatableContentDigest": "d5462dbc8f4715c7404f9a1fb88cd3984c4352756da7ac09747d848f6a349438"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.index.json.media_with_content_xUctDh.content__g1__h.text:g0lxw90rn8tj", "value": "<h2>Para regalar: el estuche de cata</h2>", "translatableContentDigest": "e894dc25a4933cc8064565a27e882e5200e50bd3c421996c3cdbb1fbc42d230c"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.media_with_content_xUctDh.content__g1__h.text:g0lxw90rn8tj", "value": "<h2>Para oferecer: a caixa de prova</h2>", "translatableContentDigest": "e894dc25a4933cc8064565a27e882e5200e50bd3c421996c3cdbb1fbc42d230c"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.index.json.media_with_content_xUctDh.content__g1__p.text:evntlnaf7kan", "value": "<p>Hojiblanca, redonda. Arbosana, afrutada. Picual, más picante. Tres botellas para notar la diferencia entre una aceituna y otra, o para regalar.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "65242fb1867c93af1797b475a624bd574cec41ded95751f0f7482f09ad027190"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.media_with_content_xUctDh.content__g1__p.text:evntlnaf7kan", "value": "<p>Hojiblanca, redonda. Arbosana, frutada. Picual, mais picante. Três garrafas para sentir a diferença entre uma azeitona e outra, ou para oferecer.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "65242fb1867c93af1797b475a624bd574cec41ded95751f0f7482f09ad027190"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.index.json.media_with_content_xUctDh.content__g2__b.label:26z9qwunoragl", "value": "Ver el estuche", "translatableContentDigest": "c3a8495393588225a11a02eb87a139c3366db0c66032c2e0a7358bd8a76eead0"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.index.json.media_with_content_xUctDh.content__g2__b.label:26z9qwunoragl", "value": "Ver a caixa", "translatableContentDigest": "c3a8495393588225a11a02eb87a139c3366db0c66032c2e0a7358bd8a76eead0"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.banner.g__p.text:1zybmi6rz6jst", "value": "<p>Virgen extra, de Andalucía. Cosecha temprana, prensado en frío.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "ef662b47a862d353748171aa3c7407c8fc3db46c17b9ebf7f751d03eba4eb8c9"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.banner.g__p.text:1zybmi6rz6jst", "value": "<p>Virgem extra, da Andaluzia. Colheita precoce, prensado a frio.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "ef662b47a862d353748171aa3c7407c8fc3db46c17b9ebf7f751d03eba4eb8c9"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.choisir.t.text:3cdsfh1c1z49b", "value": "<h2>¿Cuál elegir?</h2>", "translatableContentDigest": "e6dd77baaece66d80e98f60330b1de36345e4c63f5fcdf20559ca37b62d8322d"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.choisir.t.text:3cdsfh1c1z49b", "value": "<h2>Qual escolher?</h2>", "translatableContentDigest": "e6dd77baaece66d80e98f60330b1de36345e4c63f5fcdf20559ca37b62d8322d"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.choisir.cols__c1__h.text:l2c2gqq3qq5u", "value": "<h3>Para todos los días</h3>", "translatableContentDigest": "a68fc22c3e336463fb6faefa9db756c122515bb11afe64ad7872e3c2fcb9e12f"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.choisir.cols__c1__h.text:l2c2gqq3qq5u", "value": "<h3>Para todos os dias</h3>", "translatableContentDigest": "a68fc22c3e336463fb6faefa9db756c122515bb11afe64ad7872e3c2fcb9e12f"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.choisir.cols__c1__p.text:1v61za30ayk16", "value": "<p>La Arbequina o el Coupage. Suaves y versátiles, en crudo o en cocción suave.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "7c5ee8b8f716af5353ff08d858c1a4ecfbf84da7dbbdb827f7fd51963ba1a5a4"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.choisir.cols__c1__p.text:1v61za30ayk16", "value": "<p>A Arbequina ou o Coupage. Suaves e versáteis, em cru ou em cozedura suave.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "7c5ee8b8f716af5353ff08d858c1a4ecfbf84da7dbbdb827f7fd51963ba1a5a4"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.choisir.cols__c1__b.label:14pwk1xx4rydf", "value": "Ver la Arbequina", "translatableContentDigest": "c0c3c1c39c86ab426161613785558625acb1b7b18de5ed2b1b8a1d717a76592f"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.choisir.cols__c1__b.label:14pwk1xx4rydf", "value": "Ver a Arbequina", "translatableContentDigest": "c0c3c1c39c86ab426161613785558625acb1b7b18de5ed2b1b8a1d717a76592f"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.choisir.cols__c2__h.text:21gbkr7sdkydt", "value": "<h3>Para tomarlo en crudo</h3>", "translatableContentDigest": "44e5e9d38e28aabb54c0a6f268ff43956e2ad14a04bd20490e046c35a316708e"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.choisir.cols__c2__h.text:21gbkr7sdkydt", "value": "<h3>Para provar em cru</h3>", "translatableContentDigest": "44e5e9d38e28aabb54c0a6f268ff43956e2ad14a04bd20490e046c35a316708e"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.choisir.cols__c2__p.text:3bk1hkk2kss95", "value": "<p>La Arbequina de primera cosecha. Más fresca, con notas de manzana verde y un ligero picor.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "b4a71e175838e3509389fceec55445f39d63f89400de402a829c1aa69d2ff35b"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.choisir.cols__c2__p.text:3bk1hkk2kss95", "value": "<p>A Arbequina de primeira colheita. Mais fresca, com notas de maçã verde e um ligeiro picante.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "b4a71e175838e3509389fceec55445f39d63f89400de402a829c1aa69d2ff35b"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.choisir.cols__c2__b.label:rmpcjttni1fk", "value": "Ver la primera cosecha", "translatableContentDigest": "08118c102ee4ebaf9079e43afc9ce8015d3298f2df5c5a69622532d33f0693ee"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.choisir.cols__c2__b.label:rmpcjttni1fk", "value": "Ver a primeira colheita", "translatableContentDigest": "08118c102ee4ebaf9079e43afc9ce8015d3298f2df5c5a69622532d33f0693ee"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.choisir.cols__c3__h.text:17oyj44ax906o", "value": "<h3>Para regalar</h3>", "translatableContentDigest": "f9377e02a5a99aa84c45c0b247a12d25725e26130400b9e6a082cfcc862111fd"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.choisir.cols__c3__h.text:17oyj44ax906o", "value": "<h3>Para oferecer</h3>", "translatableContentDigest": "f9377e02a5a99aa84c45c0b247a12d25725e26130400b9e6a082cfcc862111fd"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.choisir.cols__c3__p.text:2hsofxgl4gu20", "value": "<p>El estuche de cata. Hojiblanca, Arbosana y Picual, para comparar una al lado de la otra.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "6476605b38bd673fb04d5bb9c7c7d79063fb21a1e6fc9a22cff25f550c334893"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.choisir.cols__c3__p.text:2hsofxgl4gu20", "value": "<p>A caixa de prova. Hojiblanca, Arbosana e Picual, para comparar lado a lado.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "6476605b38bd673fb04d5bb9c7c7d79063fb21a1e6fc9a22cff25f550c334893"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.choisir.cols__c3__b.label:13fkl78s2izi9", "value": "Ver el estuche", "translatableContentDigest": "c3a8495393588225a11a02eb87a139c3366db0c66032c2e0a7358bd8a76eead0"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.choisir.cols__c3__b.label:13fkl78s2izi9", "value": "Ver a caixa", "translatableContentDigest": "c3a8495393588225a11a02eb87a139c3366db0c66032c2e0a7358bd8a76eead0"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.faq.t.text:37p4ws7vbyhzw", "value": "<h2>Preguntas frecuentes</h2>", "translatableContentDigest": "ea2f490fae7cf95b9f91f1ae2c7cb1716dc1b9b6a31fcc111e13a5f7cb7e6da4"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.faq.t.text:37p4ws7vbyhzw", "value": "<h2>Perguntas frequentes</h2>", "translatableContentDigest": "ea2f490fae7cf95b9f91f1ae2c7cb1716dc1b9b6a31fcc111e13a5f7cb7e6da4"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.faq.wrap__acc__r1.heading:2bb7kmzecgunf", "value": "¿Cuáles son los plazos de entrega?", "translatableContentDigest": "996086b889f0a9af413b74e9054bd0c4456af64a9ce2e1696ab9e398be7983ad"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.faq.wrap__acc__r1.heading:2bb7kmzecgunf", "value": "Quais são os prazos de entrega?", "translatableContentDigest": "996086b889f0a9af413b74e9054bd0c4456af64a9ce2e1696ab9e398be7983ad"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.faq.wrap__acc__r1__t.text:pukfe4kydn3e", "value": "<p>Enviamos desde París con Chronopost. España peninsular, Baleares y Portugal: entrega en 2 a 3 días laborables.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "2734d3b8538731fd0ae523e9598db31b07173c9535451224dba0ba26bb07f729"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.faq.wrap__acc__r1__t.text:pukfe4kydn3e", "value": "<p>Enviamos de Paris com a Chronopost. Portugal continental, ilhas e Espanha: entrega em 2 a 3 dias úteis.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "2734d3b8538731fd0ae523e9598db31b07173c9535451224dba0ba26bb07f729"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.faq.wrap__acc__r2.heading:3vvm74t1yf83s", "value": "¿Cómo conservar mi aceite?", "translatableContentDigest": "0f892362af7dccf61fc5e2babfc2b936efa5ed5efe8f62b45f7ebc8f6ea70707"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.faq.wrap__acc__r2.heading:3vvm74t1yf83s", "value": "Como conservar o meu azeite?", "translatableContentDigest": "0f892362af7dccf61fc5e2babfc2b936efa5ed5efe8f62b45f7ebc8f6ea70707"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.faq.wrap__acc__r2__t.text:21shd79kgoll5", "value": "<p>Bien cerrado, protegido de la luz y del calor. Evita guardarlo junto a los fogones.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "0a8a4d650d7678f4536efdf6fd00712e245c0017ba7d8ddcd442aa84878bb8c8"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.faq.wrap__acc__r2__t.text:21shd79kgoll5", "value": "<p>Bem fechado, ao abrigo da luz e do calor. Evite guardá-lo ao pé do fogão.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "0a8a4d650d7678f4536efdf6fd00712e245c0017ba7d8ddcd442aa84878bb8c8"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.faq.wrap__acc__r3.heading:21kytgsmtyi21", "value": "Una botella ha llegado rota, ¿qué hago?", "translatableContentDigest": "eb3ab80182d5a5fdc956b24981ebea9fa1cbe9a208081ee20ec26e73fa57e010"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.faq.wrap__acc__r3.heading:21kytgsmtyi21", "value": "Uma garrafa chegou partida, o que faço?", "translatableContentDigest": "eb3ab80182d5a5fdc956b24981ebea9fa1cbe9a208081ee20ec26e73fa57e010"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.faq.wrap__acc__r3__t.text:4y15lvp5troo", "value": "<p>Escríbenos en 48 horas con una foto desde nuestra <a href=\"/pages/contact\">página de contacto</a>. Te la reenviamos o te la reembolsamos.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "4a34a8a3b64e6f5bfacd88d365d0812a2ec36c80433e493d49a560bec16cbeb9"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.faq.wrap__acc__r3__t.text:4y15lvp5troo", "value": "<p>Escreva-nos em 48 horas com uma fotografia através da nossa <a href=\"/pages/contact\">página de contacto</a>. Voltamos a enviá-la ou reembolsamos.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "4a34a8a3b64e6f5bfacd88d365d0812a2ec36c80433e493d49a560bec16cbeb9"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.product.json.product-information.product-details__group_J87VfC__reassure.text:259e9oakn9767", "value": "<p>Envío a España y Portugal · Pago seguro · Devolución en 14 días (botella cerrada)</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "ae66d6338fcee6aa18f5816696f7067d2db732e0ca7f8353038fdc55691f25f4"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.json.product-information.product-details__group_J87VfC__reassure.text:259e9oakn9767", "value": "<p>Envio para Portugal e Espanha · Pagamento seguro · Devolução em 14 dias (garrafa fechada)</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "ae66d6338fcee6aa18f5816696f7067d2db732e0ca7f8353038fdc55691f25f4"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.product.json.product-information.product-details__group_J87VfC__infos__r1.heading:3qeyc3s3mwtps", "value": "Envío", "translatableContentDigest": "a8b3d250ac9e1bcd509ffd32eadc4ef0c09164fdd91d99b236ea0bb4bdaa6510"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.json.product-information.product-details__group_J87VfC__infos__r1.heading:3qeyc3s3mwtps", "value": "Envio", "translatableContentDigest": "a8b3d250ac9e1bcd509ffd32eadc4ef0c09164fdd91d99b236ea0bb4bdaa6510"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.product.json.product-information.product-details__group_J87VfC__infos__r1__t.text:3dwdgexkzggoh", "value": "<p>Tu pedido sale de París con Chronopost y se entrega en España peninsular y Baleares en 2 a 3 días laborables. Los gastos se muestran en la cesta, antes del pago.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "0450c065e1b45eb858889c8b948bd469ab8ed255a456f52506b21ecbe78d6cff"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.json.product-information.product-details__group_J87VfC__infos__r1__t.text:3dwdgexkzggoh", "value": "<p>A sua encomenda sai de Paris com a Chronopost e é entregue em Portugal em 2 a 3 dias úteis. Os portes são indicados no carrinho, antes do pagamento.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "0450c065e1b45eb858889c8b948bd469ab8ed255a456f52506b21ecbe78d6cff"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.product.json.product-information.product-details__group_J87VfC__infos__r2.heading:2nnvr8xikb7ir", "value": "Conservación", "translatableContentDigest": "e43f60bbc4e69bac962d92f4e903eb284d459dd45574a3cdc7d767b5943fb26d"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.json.product-information.product-details__group_J87VfC__infos__r2.heading:2nnvr8xikb7ir", "value": "Conservação", "translatableContentDigest": "e43f60bbc4e69bac962d92f4e903eb284d459dd45574a3cdc7d767b5943fb26d"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.product.json.product-information.product-details__group_J87VfC__infos__r2__t.text:x9d9avz43y36", "value": "<p>Bien cerrado, protegido de la luz y del calor. Evita guardarlo junto a los fogones.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "0a8a4d650d7678f4536efdf6fd00712e245c0017ba7d8ddcd442aa84878bb8c8"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.json.product-information.product-details__group_J87VfC__infos__r2__t.text:x9d9avz43y36", "value": "<p>Bem fechado, ao abrigo da luz e do calor. Evite guardá-lo ao pé do fogão.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "0a8a4d650d7678f4536efdf6fd00712e245c0017ba7d8ddcd442aa84878bb8c8"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.product.json.product-information.product-details__group_J87VfC__infos__r3.heading:33e2pz6ppt8z6", "value": "Devoluciones", "translatableContentDigest": "7c442e059901cc54a0566925d705e35b921fa5f3434308d6f5568fb6f6543d90"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.json.product-information.product-details__group_J87VfC__infos__r3.heading:33e2pz6ppt8z6", "value": "Devoluções", "translatableContentDigest": "7c442e059901cc54a0566925d705e35b921fa5f3434308d6f5568fb6f6543d90"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.product.json.product-information.product-details__group_J87VfC__infos__r3__t.text:goggsjvwetdf", "value": "<p>Tienes 14 días desde la recepción para cambiar de opinión, si la botella no se ha abierto. ¿Una botella ha llegado rota? Escríbenos en 48 horas con una foto: te la reenviamos o te la reembolsamos.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "099913bf3a518215d29db852186756b102608e79c404d665e50d5b989de7d12c"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.json.product-information.product-details__group_J87VfC__infos__r3__t.text:goggsjvwetdf", "value": "<p>Tem 14 dias após a receção para mudar de ideias, se a garrafa não tiver sido aberta. Uma garrafa chegou partida? Escreva-nos em 48 horas com uma fotografia: voltamos a enviá-la ou reembolsamos.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "099913bf3a518215d29db852186756b102608e79c404d665e50d5b989de7d12c"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.product.json.product_recommendations_8RVdzU.text_w3FTGV.text:2rc4obkofn2hs", "value": "<h3>Nuestros otros aceites</h3>", "translatableContentDigest": "a6535a1f57c7ab6686ced6fa598782537b5e3b186864f355331dd2781021facb"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.json.product_recommendations_8RVdzU.text_w3FTGV.text:2rc4obkofn2hs", "value": "<h3>Os nossos outros azeites</h3>", "translatableContentDigest": "a6535a1f57c7ab6686ced6fa598782537b5e3b186864f355331dd2781021facb"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.sections/footer-group.json.section_UM49qN.text_tqMiyM.text:1oumnf91bsuhp", "value": "<h2>Sigamos en contacto</h2>", "translatableContentDigest": "e1b21028a2148d618a16522a50c26a2baedeaed2d6820aeb7e501692cde35b5a"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.sections/footer-group.json.section_UM49qN.text_tqMiyM.text:1oumnf91bsuhp", "value": "<h2>Fiquemos em contacto</h2>", "translatableContentDigest": "e1b21028a2148d618a16522a50c26a2baedeaed2d6820aeb7e501692cde35b5a"}, {"locale": "es", "key": "section.sections/footer-group.json.section_UM49qN.text_6qbwK9.text:um3hfn3k8sqw", "value": "<p>Un email cuando llega un aceite nuevo. Nada más.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "3a7772ecd20230e64fc87af5280636dbd7a179481d71b716df3a8dca5e030a94"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.sections/footer-group.json.section_UM49qN.text_6qbwK9.text:um3hfn3k8sqw", "value": "<p>Um email quando chega um azeite novo. Nada mais.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "3a7772ecd20230e64fc87af5280636dbd7a179481d71b716d